Package: aintproxy
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: sudo
Description: Modem IP rotator
 AintProxy forces a new public IP address by rotating the IP on a
 4G/5G modem via its management API. It handles Linux routing
 (ip, sysctl) and exposes rotation as a CLI tool or HTTP endpoint.
 .
 Built for CGNAT environments where the ISP hands out fresh IPs on
 modem reconnect. Currently supports Huawei HiLink gateways.
